          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_43",
        on: "saurians_rescued",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Arinexis",
            type: "Saurian Ambusher",
            side: 5,
            x: 7,
            y: 29,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Arinexis",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Arinexis",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Zedrix",
            type: "Saurian Soothsayer",
            side: 5,
            x: 8,
            y: 30,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Zedrix",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Zedrix",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("He returns! Noble Shek’kahan returns from ssspirit realm to sssave usssss! (<i>chirping sob</i>)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Resha. These... are <b>not</b> hatchlings."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("By the Winds, they are not. Their resemblance is so strikingly of hatchlings..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Ssso these are Fire Dragons, eh Zedrix? Hail, dragons! (<i>rapid clicking</i>) Down here!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("They are receiving us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Hail-loooo! Dragons, can you ssspeak? Zedrix, you sssaid dragons can ssssspeak!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Little ones! You will do as I command!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("By every sssign upon firmament, we hear you Shek’kahan! You are our moonlight!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            side: 1,
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22race%22%3A%22lizard%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_44",
        on: "loyalist_dialog",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyn",
            text: _("Rhynnin has fallen, just as I feared he would. So eager to serve his King and so very proud of his quest here; he underestimated the treachery of this accursed place and our strange enemy that would choose to shelter here. Men, I am now in command of this expedition. No more lone heroics. Signal the eastern detachment that we shall try to reunite with them along the isle’s southern shore."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("The haldric creatures have twice before seized an isle of Morogor. To have done so, they must possess a nigh drakelike cunning. Should they sense defeat approaching... They may put their settlements to the flame to deny us the stores of provisions therein. The arrival of our flight would likely startle such desperate action. We would be wise to secure all settlements before then."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_45",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Elyn%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Any lassst words, brute?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyn",
            text: _("...you have only bought yourselves a little time... ...for your cowardly attack on Fort Elense there can be no mercy for you saurians... ...you will never escape the King’s Justice..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Your king’s <b>jussstice</b>?! Your king murdered my brood sssisssters unprovoked! Your Fort Elense sssitsss over their bones!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyn",
            text: _("...the King did as he needed to, and may the Sky Father favor him for it... ...the elves would never have granted us sanctuary if he refused to do the deeds they asked of him..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyn",
            text: _("...our every action in this land is justified... ...for we are only refugees here; doing what we must to survive..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("Ssso let that be your epitaph."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_46",
        on: "moveto",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 17,
            y: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Log 72 I have found anoþer Aquadyne. It is here, deep beneaþ Þe Þree Sisters. It has only been þree years since Haldric destroyed þe elf gosts þat were sapping it and already þere is a mælstrom formed off þe norþ shore. Just like þose mælstroms Seeker Perþ discovered west of Alduin before a Wisp chased away his ship. Indeed, þere must be an Aquadyne every twenty leagues around þe entire Great Continent. Everyþing is just as Seeker Oþila had predicted. We should never have left her behind on þe Green Isle. Wiþout her work it may take centuries before we of þe Silver Order know what mankind is dealing wiþ on þis continent. Þe Færie World is stronger here þan we ever imagined. ——Someþing is wrong. I am getting a signal of warning from þe norþwest watchtower and þere is smoke rising from þe souþern iland. Rhynnin’s expedition is under attack and I sense it is more þan just þe saurians. I must go to assist. I do not have time to cypher þis log, nor can I risk taking my logbook wiþ me to perhaps be captured by an unknown enemy. Yet I shall not destroy it, þe secrecy of þe Silver Order be damned. May þe sea carry þis book back to Fort Elense so someone will know what has been discovered here."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_47",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 17,
            y: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            experience: "$($unit.experience + 16)",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22%24unit.id%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "$unit.id",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "amount",
            value: 16,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_48",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2220%22%2C%22y%22%3A%221%22%2C%22radius%22%3A%2211%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 19,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Beware the great maelstrom off the north coast."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("The tides are of no consequence to us, Resha."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Long ago, such maelstroms were strongholds of an ancient foe. I fear a thing most foul may lurk within there, even now. We would do well to keep our distance from it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("I shall keep that in mind. Carry on with your duty."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 19,
            y: 0,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_49",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 19,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("A powerful maelstrom, surrounded by paradoxically calm waters. The swirling current seems to come entirely from deep below the sandy seabed. It emanates a faint melodic humming."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("The humming grows slowly louder as a cold mist begins to billow out. The mist somehow moves against the wind."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Fly away from it! Fly!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "$unit.id",
            x: 16,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "gust.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_53",
            type: "Storm Wisp",
            side: 13,
            x: 19,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_53",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("It is just as I had feared."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Elaborate."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("This is a <i>living mist</i>, a creature of the Faerie."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Without our flight, we have not the numbers to engage this foe on equal terms. We should evade it if we can."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_51",
        on: "branch_if_51",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "drake_side.num_villages",
            equals: "$all_villages.length",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_50",
        on: "capture",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_side",
            side: 1,
            variable: "drake_side",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_villages",
            variable: "all_villages",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_51",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_52",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "saurians_rescued",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("The settlements are seized, along with all contained provisions. There is enough to feed our flight for half a dozen moons."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Upon this isle, I hereby Proclaim my Eyrie. From here my domain extends."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Resha, dispatch gliders back to Morogor with tidings. Send word also that I shall issue my summons in a year’s time. All flights with a heart hot enough to undergo the journey, will be received at this place, my eyrie. From here, they may go forth to set eyries of their own upon this greatest land."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("By your command. I wish to dispatch a sky patrol as well. To begin ceaseless watch of the Greatland just off our eastern shore."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Make it so."),
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
